"mat_plantcode": "101", "mat_code": "Sand", "mat_type": 3,
"mat_source": "Pit 22", "mat_spgr": 2.61,
"mat_absorption": 1.2, "mat_totalmoisture": 4.4 } } ] }
This renames Agg1 to Sand and sets its source, specific gravity, absorption and moisture.
