13.1 Order status
PUT orderstatus/ changes the status of existing orders and nothing else. Each record
needs order_num (or the URL's orderstatus/<order_num> , which the body must then
match) and status_id 1–7. A plant_code , if sent, must be this plant's (403 otherwise).
All other fields are ignored, even ones that couldn't be read.
