-- 27 of 35 --

deleted at the plant gets 409.
Refused tickets get these replies. error_detail names the ticket ("Ticket 9: ..."), or
"Record N" when it has no ticket_num .
Tickets are checked one after another, so when an earlier ticket fails its own checks, its
error is the one returned.
